questions.answer:
三处填空依次为：① virtual ~IPayMethod() = default; ② std::unique_ptr<IPayMethod> method_; ③ catch (const PaymentError& e)。完整关键实现为：
```cpp
struct PaymentError : std::runtime_error { using std::runtime_error::runtime_error; };
struct IPayMethod {
    virtual ~IPayMethod() = default;
    virtual std::string pay(int cents) = 0;
};
struct CardPay final : IPayMethod {
    std::string pay(int cents) override {
        if (cents > 50000) throw PaymentError("limit");
        return "card:" + std::to_string(cents);
    }
};
struct WalletPay final : IPayMethod {
    std::string pay(int cents) override { return "wallet:" + std::to_string(cents); }
};
class Checkout {
    std::unique_ptr<IPayMethod> method_;
public:
    explicit Checkout(std::unique_ptr<IPayMethod> m) : method_(std::move(m)) {}
    std::string submit(int cents) {
        try { return method_->pay(cents); }
        catch (const PaymentError& e) { return std::string("failed:") + e.what(); }
    }
};
```
该结构是策略模式：Checkout 为 Context，IPayMethod 为 Strategy，两个 Pay 类为 ConcreteStrategy；创建处按配置注入对象。流程一：CardPay、金额 3000，虚调用返回 `card:3000`。流程二：CardPay、金额 60000，抛出 PaymentError；栈展开回 Checkout::submit，由具体异常的 const 引用处理器捕获并返回 `failed:limit`。unique_ptr 表示 Checkout 独占算法对象，虚析构保证经接口指针销毁派生对象。

questions.case_material:
